  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Floriculture study Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study will map the floriculture sector in Bangladesh. It will describe the overall business ecosystem for floriculture, including its key actors and linkages, trends, challenges and (business) opportunities.The study will specifically focus on key groups of actors to increase the earning capacity for local companies, by focusing on input providers, growers and traders.Ideally the outcomes will:i.	Provide further insights in the Bangladeshi floriculture business ecosystem;ii.	Understand the key bottlenecks that hamper growth in the floriculture sector, especially among input providers, growers and traders;iii.	Suggest interventions to support these key actors;iv.	Provide details for Dutch companies and institutes active in the horticulture value chain to boost the floriculture sector of Bangladesh as a whole, through investments, knowledge or technology.With the overall purpose to realise growth in the floriculture sector of Bangladesh by increasing size and efficiency in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
